{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>If a sign.</b> In the heavens, as the matter stated regarding Gideon (Judges 6): ״וְעָשִׂיתָ לִּי אוֹת״ — and it says ״יְהִי נָא חֹרֶב אֶל הַגִּזָּה״, etc." "<b>Or a wonder.</b> On the earth. Even so, do not listen to him. And if you say: for what reason does the Holy One, blessed be He, give him power to perform a sign? — <b>For YHWH your Elohim is testing you</b> (Sifrei; see Sanhedrin 90a)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:46:53.423131657Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}